        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/CoastalTown/_scene_mamba.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 5edd7e34-2ad3-438b-beb1-8c3ada5846ea).Image",
        "Description": "After the elimination of Ivan Berezovski and Mrs. Mookjai, ICA intel traced the criminal network to Sapienza. Fabian Desch, a corrupt pharmaceutical investor, financed illegal chemical research tied to the trafficking operation. His partner, former military engineer Hansi Schuhmacher, handled security and smuggling across Europe. Both men are preparing to sell dangerous research data to anonymous buyers. Today, they are at the Abiatti-festival. Find them and do what you can best.\r\rGood luck, 47.",
